## **10. RENDER DEPLOYMENT SPECIFIC RULES**

### **Pre-Deployment Checklist:**
- [ ] **Environment Variables**: All required env vars configured in Render
- [ ] **Build Commands**: Correct build and start commands set
- [ ] **Health Checks**: Health endpoint configured
- [ ] **Resource Allocation**: Appropriate instance size selected
- [ ] **Auto-Deploy**: Configured for main branch
- [ ] **Custom Domains**: SSL certificates and domains configured
- [ ] **Monitoring**: Render monitoring alerts enabled

### **Post-Deployment Verification:**
- [ ] **Service Status**: All services running and healthy
- [ ] **API Endpoints**: All endpoints responding correctly
- [ ] **Database Connectivity**: Firebase connection established
- [ ] **Authentication**: Firebase Auth working properly
- [ ] **File Uploads**: Firebase Storage functioning
- [ ] **Performance**: Response times within acceptable range
- [ ] **Error Monitoring**: Error tracking operational

